    "chunk_text": "f\u00f0 emnihte. Estas is sumor, se h\u00e6f\u00f0 sunstede. Autumnus is h\u00e6rfest, se h\u00e6f\u00f0 o\u00f0re emnihte. Hiemps is winter, se h\u00e6f\u00f0 o\u00f0erne sunstede. On \u00f0isum feower tidum yrn\u00f0 seo sunne geond mislice d\u00e6las bufon \u00f0isum ymbhwyrfte, & \u00feas eor\u00f0an So\u00f0lice \u00feurh Godes foresceawunge \u00fe\u00e6t heo symle on anre stowe ne wunige, & mid hire h\u00e6tan Ac heo g\u00e6\u00f0 geond stowa, & tempra\u00f0 \u00fea eor\u00f0lican w\u00e6stmas, \u00e6g\u00f0er ge on w\u00e6stme ge on ripunge. \u00deonne se d\u00e6g langa\u00f0 \u00feonne g\u00e6\u00f0 seo sunne nor\u00f0weard o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t heo becym\u00f0 to \u00f0am tacne \u00fee is gehaten \u00d0onne heo nor\u00f0weard bi\u00f0, \u00feonne maca\u00f0 heo lenctenlice emnihte on middeweardum hire ryne. Eft \u00f0onne heo su\u00f0weard bi\u00f0, \u00feonne maca\u00f0 heo h\u00e6rfestlice emnihte. Swa heo su\u00f0or bi\u00f0 swa hit swi\u00f0or winterl\u00e6c\u00f0, & g\u00e6\u00f0 se winterlica cyle \u00e6fter hire, ac \u00f0onne heo eft Se langigenda d\u00e6g is ceald for\u00f0an \u00fee seo eor\u00f0e bi\u00f0 mid \u00f0am winterlicum cyle \u00feurhgan, & bi\u00f0 Se sceortigenda d\u00e6g h\u00e6f\u00f0 li\u00f0ran gewederu \u00feonne se langigenda, for\u00f0an \u00fee seo eor\u00f0e is eal gebe\u00f0od Witodlice se winterlica mona g\u00e6\u00f0 nor\u00f0or \u00feonne seo sunne gange on sumera, & for\u00f0i h\u00e6f\u00f0 scyrtran Eft on langiendum dagum he oferg\u00e6\u00f0 \u00f0one su\u00f0ran sunstede, & for\u00f0i bi\u00f0 ny\u00f0or gesewen \u00f0onne seo",
